<title>USA: FOMC begins two-day meeting, no rate change seen.</title>
<headline>FOMC begins two-day meeting, no rate change seen.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Reserve policymakers began a two-day meeting on Tuesday, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>The central bank is widely expected to decide at the meeting to leave interest rates unchanged.</p>
<p>Its policy-setting Federal Open Market Committee is slated to announce its decision at about 2:15 p.m. (1815 GMT) on Wednesday.</p>
